# docs/Certificates is the Drive export of clients' B-BBEE certificates (2,955
# files, 2.6 GB) and docs/Test Data is a live client's evidence pack. The
# existing *.pdf rule caught most of it but let ~41 scans through as .jpg/.png/
# .zip, which would have published named companies' certificates to GitHub.
# The authoritative copies live in the okirubackups2026 storage account.
docs/Certificates/
docs/Test Data/
